~ start
[speed=0.7]We're at the evacuation center now.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]There's so many people here.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Some are crying. Some are sleeping on the floor.[/speed]

[speed=0.6]Everyone looks tired.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Nanay keeps hugging us. She won't let go.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I'm glad she's here. I'm glad Ate Valerie is here.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Kuya Dodong and Kiki too.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]And Noni...[/speed]

[speed=0.8]Someone found him.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]I thought I was dreaming.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]He was all wet and shivering but.. he was alive.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]He's here now sitting beside me.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]I keep holding his hand just to make sure he's really here. But...I'm glad he's safe.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]But Tatay...[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=7 level=3]Tatay isn't here.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]Nanay said they're still looking for him.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]She said Tatay is strong.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I know he is.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I believe in my Tatay.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]He can carry heavy sacks of coconuts. He can fix our roof. He can carry me on his shoulders like I'm not heavy at all.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]So he can come back, right?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]Every time someone enters, I look up. I keep thinking it's him.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=5 level=2]I want to tell him I'm sorry.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=6 level=3]I'm sorry I didn't always listen.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6][shake rate=7 level=3]I'm sorry I couldn't help more.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]I want to tell him that I'm eight now.[/speed]

[speed=0.7][shake rate=5 level=2]I'm a big boy now, Tatay. I can do things by myself.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=8 level=5]But I still want you here.[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.7]Nanay says we should be thankful we're alive.[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I am.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I'm thankful Nanay is here.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I'm thankful Ate Valerie, Kuya Dodong, Noni and Kiki are here.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I really am.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]But...[/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=8 level=4]Why isn't Tatay here, too?[/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.6][shake rate=8 level=4][b]Tatay... We're waiting for you.[/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.5][shake rate=10 level=5][b]You said you'd be here...[/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.5][shake rate=15 level=8][b]Please find your way home.[/b][/shake][/speed]

=> END